                leur
                <a class="underline text-blue-200" href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/privacy">Politique de
                    confidentialité</a>
                et leurs <a class="underline text-blue-200" href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/terms">Conditions
                    d'utilisation</a> s'appliquent.
            </p>

            <div>
                <ul class="flex items-center justify-center mt-5">
                    <li class="mr-5"><a target="_blank"
                            href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61569319857908"><img src="images/facebook.png"
                                width="60" /></a></li>
                    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://www.instagram.com/saona.beaute.evasion/"><img
                                src="images/instagram.png" width="60"></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="scripts/source.js"></script>
